{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45081","headline":"经仙人渚即沈山下古人沈义白日昇仙处 · 皎然","name":"经仙人渚即沈山下古人沈义白日昇仙处","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日月人间短，何时此得仙。\n古山春已尽，遗渚事空传。\n不见腾云驾，徒临洗药泉。\n如今成逝水，翻使恨流年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45081.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45081","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}